# Excluded, not gitignored-by-mistake: npm's optional-dependency resolution
# (rollup/esbuild native binaries) only fully locks the authoring platform's
# variant, which breaks cross-platform installs (macOS dev -> Vercel's Linux
# build). Let each environment resolve its own lockfile instead.
package-lock.json

